# Web patterns

- **Server state**: TanStack React Query; keys by resource (`receipts`, `receipts/:id`, `insights`, `subscriptions`)
- **UI state**: Zustand (drawers, upload progress, date range, sidebar)
- **Forms**: React Hook Form + Zod; reuse schemas from `@receiptbrain/contracts` on both client and server
- **Components**: live in `apps/web/components`; shared primitives in `packages/ui`
- **Money rendering**: always with currency code; never assume USD
- **Pages**: card layout, responsive, loading skeletons (stable dimensions, no CLS), error boundaries, **empty states**
- **Optimistic updates**: PATCH on receipt corrections and insight status — rollback on mutation failure
- **Mobile capture**: ReceiptUploader uses `<input type="file" accept="image/*" capture="environment">` as a first-class flow alongside drag/drop
- **Confidence chips**: ReceiptCard + ReceiptDetailEditor highlight fields with `fieldConfidence < 0.7`
- **Explainability**: every InsightCard shows source receipts ("based on N receipts") and a dismiss/action button

## Routes (outline)

`/`, `/(auth)/sign-in`, `/dashboard`, `/receipts`, `/receipts/[id]`, `/upload`, `/subscriptions`, `/insights`, `/settings`

## API consumption

- Use typed fetch wrappers in `packages/lib`; payloads typed via `@receiptbrain/contracts`
- Never call OpenAI from the browser
- Upload page polls `GET /api/receipts/:id/status` until `extracted | needs_review | failed`
